 meeting:"Dear Parent/Guardian, {{school_name}} invites you to a parents' meeting on {{date}}. {{extra}} Your participation is important. Thank you.",
 exam:"Dear Parent/Guardian, examinations at {{school_name}} are scheduled for {{date}}. Please ensure {{learner_name}} in {{grade}} is prepared. {{extra}}",
 opening:"Dear Parent/Guardian, {{school_name}} will reopen on {{date}}. Please ensure {{learner_name}} in {{grade}} reports on time. {{extra}}",
 closing:"Dear Parent/Guardian, {{school_name}} will close on {{date}}. {{extra}} Thank you for your support.",
